A few weeks ago a fellow gave a talk here at the U of Buffalo.
He gave subjects some processing task and imaged their brains while
performing it.  I expect it was PET or functional MRI.
I only remember that the task involved
reading nouns and giving some response.

They found that there was significant activation in the _cerebellum_
